 "title": "Logo Animation and Motion Identity Systems", "description": "This unit shows how motion extends brand identity through animated marks, transitions, mnemonic gestures, sonic identity, and reusable system rules.", "children": [{"id": "d6bff734-21ce-4334-b357-5f4845f6ff13", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Animated marks and logo behavior", "children": [{"id": "cffdd6d0-38a6-4e1d-a00e-11c1e9e23d48", "type": "concept", "title": "logo reveal"}, {"id": "9db79152-a87c-4298-8f91-44963ddea875", "type": "concept", "title": "morph"}, {"id": "4819f4cb-55e6-416b-87fd-ed7e24c638c9", "type": "concept", "title": "build-on"}, {"id": "5976c458-5ece-4192-82e1-b5402342f9d4", "type": "concept", "title": "lockup"}, {"id": "5ec9d3a5-0588-44b4-b9da-74c2b8f54bb2", "type": "concept", "title": "brand mnemonic"}, {"id": "eedc463e-22d1-4f67-9af9-e220ead4a442", "type": "concept", "title": "motion signature"}], "description": "Students learn to animate logos through transformation, assembly, reveal, morphing, and responsive movement."}, {"id": "39075f35-7c60-4e08-bc48-3fd73dbf2140", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Motion brand guidelines", "children": [{"id": "d024faec-42ff-4721-bf3b-3143de049c40", "type": "concept", "title": "motion principle"}, {"id": "4a110942-1d23-4601-9c3e-fc061d99e1b2", "type": "concept", "title": "duration rule"}, {"id": "a7be5120-6cdd-4d2b-a329-d8ad2461deda", "type": "concept", "title": "easing curve"}, {"id": "6a6fd635-fd5c-4e6e-99dd-1fe1eb1cb245", "type": "concept", "title": "transition system"}, {"id": "a1e089c9-30e6-4e69-8951-0aaa31ce7e6a", "type": "concept", "title": "brand behavior"}, {"id": "4d1d5232-c4fb-4b7e-81d0-5fc737a480df", "type": "concept", "title": "usage guideline"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces the rules that keep identity animation consistent across platforms and teams."}, {"id": "9543fa5d-0281-4b08-8f0e-17bfaf126940", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sonic and sensory identity", "children": [{"id": "2040ab25-5f1b-4381-9b41-b36ccf2a536b"